---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Tools" description="Case finders and solvers for ZBRoux and LEOR.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Tools</h1>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="/tools/trainer/">Trainer</a></td><td>Drill EODFDB and ZBLL cases with random setups and a timer, weakest cases first.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/algs/eodfdb/">EODFDB case finder</a></td><td>Find your EODFDB case from what you see, or from a scramble and your block moves.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/algs/zbll/">ZBLL case finder</a></td><td>Find your ZBLL case by tapping the colors you see, or from a scramble and your moves so far.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/tools/breakdown/">Solve breakdown</a></td><td>Paste a scramble and a full ZBRoux solution. It splits the solution into stages, checks each one, and looks up your EODFDB and ZBLL cases.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/tools/eostripe-solver/">EOStripe solver</a></td><td>Every shortest EOStripe solution for a LEOR solve.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </article>
</Base>
